From 0f147fd2ac932e6890555383e761868c19063c42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel Teperino <miguel@geotraser.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:34:56 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Send battery and signal readings with each position

Every GPS fix now carries a device snapshot (battery %, charging, low-power
mode, connection type, cellular generation, last upload RTT, GPS accuracy)
on both the live position post and the historic route point. Offline-queued
samples store the snapshot from capture time and send it on flush.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
